1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,308
Take any vector in the plane and apply this matrix to it.

2
00:00:04,308 --> 00:00:05,573
Watch the grid.

3
00:00:05,573 --> 00:00:12,235
It stretches, it tilts, and almost every vector is knocked off the line it started on.

4
00:00:12,235 --> 00:00:13,220
Almost.

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:16,161
A few special directions refuse to turn.

6
00:00:16,161 --> 00:00:19,823
They only get longer, shorter, or flipped.

7
00:00:19,823 --> 00:00:23,058
Which directions are these, and why do they matter?

8
00:00:23,058 --> 00:00:24,338
Let's find out.

